        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "part": 3,
      "label": "Part 3",
      "instruction": "Talk together with your partner about the situation.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 20,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img2"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Talk with your partner about the things a class could take on a day trip walking in the mountains, and decide which would be most useful."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now, in this part of the test you’re going to talk about something together for about two minutes. I’m going to describe a situation to you. A class is going on a day trip walking in the mountains with their teacher. Here are some things they could take with them. Talk together about the different things they could take with them and say which would be most useful. All right? Now, talk together.",
                "role": "examiner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 28.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Shall I start? I think the map is really important, because they could get lost in the mountains. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.1
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Good idea. What about the warm hat? It can be very cold at the top of a mountain. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "I’m not sure about the football. They’ll be walking all day, so will they have time to play? What’s your opinion?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.1
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "What about the camera and the umbrella? The views are beautiful, but carrying an umbrella all day could be difficult. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "And they need food and drink, so the water and the chocolate are useful too, aren’t they?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.1
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which one do you think would be most useful? I think the water, because you get very thirsty when you walk.",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet1/pet1-t1-s-q3-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.8
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
